==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2019–20 Scottish Premiership}}
The [[2019–20 Scottish Premiership|Scottish Premiership]] fixture list was announced on 21 June 2019. Celtic began their title defence against [[St Johnstone F.C.|St Johnstone]] at [[Celtic Park]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/16330 | title=Celtic kick off new season with Flag Day game against St Johnstone | publisher=Celtic FC | date=21 June 2019 | access-date=21 June 2019 | archive-date=21 June 2019 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190621085117/http://www.celticfc.net/news/16330 | url-status=live }}</ref>

