===Group stage===
On 30 August, the draw for the [[2019–20 UEFA Europa League#Group stage|2019–20 UEFA Europa League group stage]] was made. Celtic were drawn in [[2019–20 UEFA Europa League#Group E|Group E]] along with [[S.S. Lazio|Lazio]] (Pot 1), [[Stade Rennais F.C.|Rennes]] (Pot 3) and [[CFR Cluj]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/16726 | title=Celtic's UEFA Europa League Group E opponents | publisher=Celtic FC | date=30 August 2019 | access-date=30 August 2019 | archive-date=30 August 2019 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190830124853/http://www.celticfc.net/news/16726 | url-status=live }}</ref>

